Subject: Cantor Identity Accounting Workspace P0 Justification

& [Decision]
  + implement identity accounting as a pure sidecar to SharedAttentionFrame rather than pretending transformer attention supplies durable pointers
  + make readable handles primary because inference must point forward while hashes remain integrity and stale-version controls
  + require complete scoped coverage because an omitted same-type member defeats accountability even when the remaining prose is coherent
  + keep admission removal persistence and effects outside P0 so conservation and reference behavior can be proved in isolation
